%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': {'primaryColor':'#eef2ff','primaryTextColor':'#0f172a','primaryBorderColor':'#4f46e5','lineColor':'#64748b','fontFamily':'sans-serif'}}}%%
classDiagram
    direction TB

    class Result~T~ {
        «统一响应»
        - Integer code
        - String msg
        - T data
        - String traceId
        + success()$ Result~T~
        + success(data)$ Result~T~
        + success(data, traceId)$ Result~T~
        + error()$ Result~T~
        + error(msg)$ Result~T~
        + error(code, msg)$ Result~T~
        + error(ResultCode)$ Result~T~
        + error(ErrorCode)$ Result~T~
        + setTraceId(traceId) Result~T~
    }
    note for Result "code=0 表示成功（非 HTTP 200）\ntraceId 全链路追踪\n泛型 T 为业务数据载体"

    class ResultCode {
        «enumeration · 响应码»
        SUCCESS(0, "成功", "sys.success")
        - Integer code
        - String msg
        - String messageKey
        + fromCode(code)$ ResultCode
    }

    class ErrorCode {
        «enumeration · 错误码»
        AUTH_FAILED(1004)
        BUSINESS_RULE_VIOLATION(3001)
        - int code
        - String message
        + fromCode(code)$ ErrorCode
    }

    class BaseException {
        «abstract · 基础异常»
        - Integer code
        - String msg
        - String messageKey
        + BaseException(message)
        + BaseException(code, message)
        + BaseException(ResultCode)
        + BaseException(ResultCode, message)
    }

    class BusinessException {
        «业务异常»
        + BusinessException(message)
        + BusinessException(code, message)
        + BusinessException(ResultCode)
        + BusinessException(ResultCode, message)
        + BusinessException(message, cause)
    }

    class BaseEntity {
        «abstract · 领域基类»
        # Long id
        # LocalDateTime createTime
        # LocalDateTime updateTime
        # Integer lockVersion
        # Integer deleted
        + isDeleted() boolean
        + markAsDeleted()
        + restore()
        + isNew() boolean
    }
    note for BaseEntity "LogicalDeletion 枚举: NOT_DELETED(0)/DELETED(1)\n@SuperBuilder 构造\n领域实体继承此类"

    class BasePO {
        «persistence · 持久化基类»
        - Long id @TableId(ASSIGN_ID)
        - LocalDateTime createTime
        - LocalDateTime updateTime
        - Integer version @Version
        - Integer deleted @TableLogic
        + getLockVersion() Integer
        + setLockVersion(v)
    }
    note for BasePO "@SuperBuilder · implements Serializable\n@TableId 雪花算法\n@Version 乐观锁\n@TableLogic 逻辑删除\nPO 仅用于持久化，与 DO 分离"

    class TenantContext {
        «上下文 · 租户»
        - ThreadLocal~String~ TENANT_ID
        + setTenantId(id) String
        + restoreTenantId(previous)
        + currentTenantId() Optional~String~
        + clear()
        + withTenant(id) Context
        + withTenant(Mono) Mono
        + withTenant(Flux) Flux
        + initializeGlobalHooks()
    }
    note for TenantContext "ThreadLocal + Reactor Context 双桥接\nSchedulers hook 自动传播\n租户作用域来自受信任认证上下文"

    class DataScopeContext {
        «上下文 · 数据权限»
        - ThreadLocal~Scope~ SCOPE
        + setDataScope(info)
        + setDataScope(info, config)
        + currentDataScope() Optional~DataScopeInfo~
        + currentScope() Optional~Scope~
        + install(scope) AutoCloseable
    }

    class DataSourceContext {
        «上下文 · 数据源»
        - ThreadLocal~Deque~String~~ STACK
        + push(ds)
        + pop() String
        + current() String
        + clear()
    }

    class BlockingIoSchedulers {
        «调度器 · 阻塞I/O隔离»
        - AtomicReference~Scheduler~ JDBC
        - AtomicReference~Scheduler~ CACHE
        - AtomicReference~Scheduler~ STORAGE
        - AtomicReference~Scheduler~ EVENT
        - AtomicReference~Scheduler~ REMOTE
        - AtomicReference~Scheduler~ GENERAL
        + jdbc()$ Scheduler
        + cache()$ Scheduler
        + storage()$ Scheduler
        + event()$ Scheduler
        + remote()$ Scheduler
        + general()$ Scheduler
    }
    note for BlockingIoSchedulers "六池隔离: jdbc(32) cache(4) storage(8)\nevent(2) remote(16) general(16)\n每池可配 virtual-threads=true\n禁止直接用 Schedulers.boundedElastic()"

    class VirtualThreadBoundedExecutor {
        «虚拟线程执行器»
        - int maxConcurrency
        - Queue~Runnable~ queue
        + submit(task)
        + offer(task) boolean
    }

    %% ---- 异常继承 ----
    BusinessException --|> BaseException

    %% ---- 响应体系 ----
    Result~T~ ..> ResultCode : «use»
    Result~T~ ..> ErrorCode : «use»
    BaseException ..> ResultCode : «use»

    %% ---- 持久化基类 ----
    BaseEntity ..> BasePO : «transient 转换»

    %% ---- 上下文体系 ----
    TenantContext ..> BaseEntity : «租户隔离»
    DataScopeContext ..> BaseEntity : «数据权限»

    %% ---- 调度器 ----
    BlockingIoSchedulers ..> VirtualThreadBoundedExecutor : «virtual-threads 模式»
    BlockingIoSchedulers ..> TenantContext : «Schedulers hook 传播»
